# ComposeLifecycle

TLC reached 64 states and 158 steps. The chart draws 10 states and 28 arrows.
The chart does not draw 61 steps that stay in one chart state.

## OpenAPITrafficGated breaks
The shortest path has 1 step:
0. Provisioning shared network
1. an OpenAPI request is admitted after every gate holds: Unsafe traffic admitted

## PlannedRollRetainsCapacity breaks
The shortest path has 13 steps:
0. Provisioning shared network
1. operator creates the explicit shared network: Provisioning Obot dependencies
2. PostgreSQL starts: Provisioning Obot dependencies
3. PostgreSQL passes readiness: Provisioning service authentication
4. service certificates are staged: Provisioning service authentication
5. the service CA becomes trusted: Provisioning Obot
6. an Obot replica starts: Provisioning Obot
7. the Obot replica passes readiness: Provisioning Workers
8. a Worker starts on the trusted shared network: Provisioning Workers
9. the Worker passes readiness: Both stacks ready, traffic closed
10. a Worker starts on the trusted shared network: Both stacks ready, traffic closed
11. the Worker passes readiness: Both stacks ready, traffic closed
12. a one-at-a-time Obot upgrade starts: Rolling upgrade, capacity retained
13. the Obot replica drains while another serves: Rolling upgrade, capacity lost

## Rules that hold
TypeOK, NoDeadlock, CHECK_DEADLOCK

